Files: usr/lib/vintner/payloads/*
Copyright: the authors of the upstream packages named in usr/lib/vintner/payloads/VERSIONS
License: other
 vintner-platform carries unmodified files of Debian packages, so each file
 keeps the licence of its upstream: systemd-boot and the systemd-stub
 (systemd-boot-efi): LGPL-2.1-or-later; GRUB (grub-pc-bin): GPL-3.0-or-later;
 the recovery kernel and initramfs contents: GPL-2.0 and others, per package.
 The source of each is in the Debian source packages of the versions listed in
 usr/lib/vintner/payloads/VERSIONS (apt-get source, or
 https://snapshot.debian.org), and the recovery initramfs holds vintner itself
 (GPL-2+). Not part of this source tree; they are added at build time.
